{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b9f4c1a2-7e3d-4a5b-9c8e-1d2f3a4b5c6d",
    "name": "lede API",
    "description": "Postman collection for the lede backend API.\n\nBase URL: `{{baseUrl}}` (default `http://localhost:3000`)\nAll endpoints are under `/api/v1` (health checks are under `/api`).\n\n## Authentication\nEvery request except the public ones (register, login, refresh, forgot/reset password, health, VAPID key, public directory) sends an `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header. The collection is configured at the collection level to use `{{accessToken}}` as that bearer token, so once a token is set every request inherits it.\n\nThe backend accepts **two** kinds of bearer token (see `packages/backend/src/plugins/auth.plugin.ts`):\n- a **JWT** access token returned by `POST /auth/login` or `POST /auth/register` (expires after 1 hour), or\n- a long-lived **API key** that looks like `nrk_...`, created via `POST /auth/api-keys`.\n\n### Quick start (JWT)\n1. Set the `baseUrl` variable (or import the environment file) and pick the environment.\n2. Run **Auth -> Login** (or **Register**). Its test script stores `accessToken` and `refreshToken` collection variables automatically.\n3. Call any other request - it inherits `{{accessToken}}`.\n4. When the token expires (1h), run **Auth -> Refresh Token** to mint a new one.\n\n### Long-lived access (API key)\n1. Authenticate with JWT once (above).\n2. Run **Auth -> Create API Key**. Its test script stores the returned `nrk_...` value in the `apiKey` variable. The raw key is shown only once.\n3. To use it for all requests, set `accessToken` to the API key value (Collection -> Variables), or paste the `nrk_...` straight into the `accessToken` current value. Because the backend treats JWTs and API keys the same way, no other change is needed.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "apiKey", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "feedId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "articleId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "folderId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tagId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.accessToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "if (json.refreshToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"you@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"supersecret123\",\n  \"displayName\": \"Your Name\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new account. Returns `{ user, accessToken, refreshToken }`. The test script saves the tokens."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.accessToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "if (json.refreshToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"you@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"supersecret123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Log in with email + password. Returns `{ user, accessToken, refreshToken }`. The test script saves the tokens so every other request is authenticated automatically."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.accessToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "if (json.refreshToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Exchange a refresh token for a fresh access token (run this when the 1h JWT expires)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot Password",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"you@example.com\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "forgot-password"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset Password",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"<reset-token-from-email>\",\n  \"password\": \"newsupersecret123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "reset-password"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create API Key",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.key) pm.collectionVariables.set('apiKey', json.key);",
                  "console.log('API key (shown once):', json.key);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"my-script\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/api-keys",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "api-keys"]
            },
            "description": "Create a long-lived API key (`nrk_...`). The raw key is returned only once and saved to the `apiKey` variable. Optional `expiresAt` is an ISO-8601 datetime."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List API Keys",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/api-keys",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "api-keys"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete API Key",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/api-keys/:keyId",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "api-keys", ":keyId"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "keyId", "value": "" }]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
